{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> PLAYNESE: Master Japanese</strong> is a unique JRPG adventure designed specifically <u><strong>for anyone learning Japanese</strong></u>, from absolute beginners to those preparing for Japanese Language Tests (like the JLPT).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<u><strong>The Study-Play Game Loop</strong></u><strong>:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1.</strong> Study Japanese to earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2.</strong> Buy powerful cards and battle creatures from a mad scientist.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3.</strong> Unlock new areas with badges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbHunt for rare cards, do quests for locals to earn cash, and build the ultimate deck! Master Japanese as you play, battle, and explore.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/6e319a11e875e7391cb4efaaedd99190.avif?t=1750867497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStudy using charts, mnemonics, and JLPT quizzes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/Hiragana_Chart_STEAM.png?t=1750867497\" /></div>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbEarn badges to unlock new areas, tougher challenges, and exciting experiences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/21e50a2687ac0db0e3225f00cbb2ae59.avif?t=1750867497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbWhether you\u2019re just starting with <strong>Hiragana, Katakana, Kanji</strong>, or working your way through grammar and vocabulary, PLAYNESE offers an engaging, immersive way to practice reading, writing, and comprehension.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Absorb Japanese naturally while having fun</u>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u><strong>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn and practice Hiragana (\u3072\u3089\u304c\u306a), Katakana (\u30ab\u30bf\u30ab\u30ca) and Kanji (\u6f22\u5b57)</strong> through interactive lessons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level up your reading, writing, and listening</strong> with JLPT-aligned content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use Japanese-themed cards</strong> to battle monsters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/0a58ffc6d6aeb28e4aa24716b20907b4.avif?t=1750867497\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbPLAYNESE is a comprehensive language learning tool wrapped in a JRPG adventure. Whether your goal is to pass the JLPT, speak more confidently, or simply enjoy learning Japanese in a fun and motivating way, PLAYNESE supports you every step of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStart your adventure today, and transform your Japanese learning journey into an unforgettable experience!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1750867497","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1750867497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/66c6dcd3f96cfd6ffaab7985eea558d7a97507fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750867497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/66c6dcd3f96cfd6ffaab7985eea558d7a97507fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750867497","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"